       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ROUNDDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRICE PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 19.99.
       01 TAX-RATE PIC 9V999 VALUE 0.075.
       01 TRUNCATED PIC 9(3)V99.
       01 ROUNDED-AMT PIC 9(3)V99.
       01 WHOLE PIC 9(3).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
